          </div>

          <p>You don't need to calculate a score.</p>

          <p>Simply ask yourself:</p>

          <blockquote>
            "Do I want to continue this conversation?"
          </blockquote>

          <p>If the answer is no, you have your answer.</p>

          <hr />

